y of the attack now with that  explained it's time to move on to how  the gun Devil's appearance was directly  tied to chainsaw man and makima herself  in order to do this we need to discuss  info that won't be revealed in the anime  for a long time so if you're an anime  only Watcher and don't want to know  anything then this is the time to pause  the video hit that sub button and come  back when you're ready to hear a few  spoilers for everyone else it's time to  break down what really happened in the  1980s and the place we need to begin is  chapter 73. in that chapter makama  revealed some mind-blowing Intel to  denji in the gang which is that the gun  devil was actually captured by humans on  the same day it first appeared minutes  after entering the Soviet Union the  Soviet Army found its own unconscious  body lying on the ground because it had  already been defeated by an unknown  person the person who took it down was  never specified however if we piece all  the clues together so far including the  fact that pachita had two bullet wounds  during this flashback then the timeline  starts to become clear what I think  happened is that on November the 18th  pachita was in hell when he was  confronted by the control devil War  devil gun devil and a few other Devils  that show up later in the series the  evidence for this is that in chapter 87  makima stated that at some point in the  past pachita had an epic battle against  the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse and  the weapons Devils which obviously would  have included the gun during this epic  fight in hell we know that chainsaw man  took a bite out of the war devil  significantly reducing her strength and  he also ate a few of the weapons Devils  which erased some of their names from  existence following that he and the gun  devil must have severely wounded each  other which is when the fight began to  go in a completely different Direction  with Batista being too injured to  continue he decided to escape through  one of the doors in Hell explaining why  why makima said that he vanished during  the height of the battle by the way the  Maga made it clear that many of these  doors are connected to locations on  Earth proven in chapter 84 when he uses  one of them to travel to Tokyo back in  1984 though a ninja pachita went through  a door that took him to another part of  Japan where he meets denji for the first  time suffering from serious gunshot  wounds from the gun devil his body then  morphed into a tiny orange dog which is  something machama describes his  near-death form as you saw in the anime  denji then offered human blood to help  pachita to regenerate himself and the  two of them form a binding contract  where they agree to help each other  going forward at the exact same time Dan  and Hell after chainsaw man vanish it  was confirmed that the other Devils did  try to find him my assumption is that  they each must have split up and gone  through different doors with the bomb  devil arriving in the Soviet Union the  arrow devil arriving in China the  control devil arriving in Tokyo for the  first time and the gun devil arriving  somewhere in Japan at 10 am the wounded  gun devil then blitzed through the  country looking for pachita and within a  few minutes he goes through America  Canada India and all the other nations  we mentioned earlier before finally  collapsing in the Soviet Union from his  injuries this is why the mystery person  who defeated the gun devil was nowhere  to be seen because petite had already  done the damage back when they were in  hell anyhow after the gun fell  unconscious the Soviets took what was  left of its body for themselves while  over in Japan makama began her long  search to find chainsaw man in order to  do this properly she needed certain  resources which is why she made a  contract with the Japanese prime  minister in exchange for offering her  services to the public safety double  Hunters the Prime Minister gave her a  deal in which any attacks made on her  would be transferred to random Japanese  civilians this essentially made her  invincible and thanks to the resources  in public safety she was able to track  down all of Chainsaw man's allies over  the years for example she Tracked Down  the angel devil to a remote Village and  sometime after that she captured beam  power princy and several other allies  who used to be followers of Chainsaw man  however despite all her searching she  was never able to find himself and  that's because he remained in his  near-death form making himself  unrecognizable it was only when she met  denji in 1997 that makima finally found  what she was looking for and she then  slowly began planting seeds that would  enable her to take control of Chainsaw  man for herself for the purpose of this  video it's not really necessary for me  to spoil how she tries to do this but  just know that taking control of pachita  was likely her goal all the way back  when she first confronted him in hell  switching over to the Soviet Union as we  established they were the ones who found  what was left of the gun Devil's main  body this means that in the 1980s the  Soviets would have possessed 63 percent  of the gun devil while the remaining 37  percent were scattered around the world  as Tiny bullets most of those bullets  were then consumed by lower ranking  Devils to make themselves more powerful  but what's really interesting here is  how America reacted to all of this  somehow between 1984 and 1997 the Soviet  share of Uganda was body decreased down  to just 28 percent while the US somehow  gained 20 percent of the body for  herself and a few other countries also  got some smaller percentages now for all  we know some of those countries could  have paid large amounts of money for it  but when it comes to America there's a  scene in episode 2 that makes me think  they might have just straight up stolen  it in this scene Maximus higher-ups talk  about how the American ma